### Create a ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Can't log in after password reset",
  "description": "I reset my password this morning using the email link, but the login page still says my credentials are invalid."
}

### Create a second ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Invoice shows the wrong billing address",
  "description": "Our latest invoice still lists the old office address. We updated it in account settings two weeks ago."
}

### List all tickets
GET http://localhost:8080/tickets

### Get one ticket
GET http://localhost:8080/tickets/1

### Get a ticket that doesn't exist
GET http://localhost:8080/tickets/99

### Try to set internal fields
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 500,
  "title": "Report export to CSV times out",
  "description": "Exporting the monthly report fails after about 30 seconds with a timeout message.",
  "status": "RESOLVED"
}

### Count tickets (challenge)
GET http://localhost:8080/tickets/count

### Dashboard summary
GET http://localhost:8080/dashboard/summary
